Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 10:17:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] campaigns/erdos-ternary: g001-e01 C port of the g0 DFS
 (search/c1)

search/c1/tree_c1.c: DFS per verify/CERT.md with 2^r mod 3^240 kept in six
base-3^40 limbs, children via truncated mulmod by precomputed 2^(P_k) and
2^(2P_k), preinverse reduction by 3^40 (Moller-Granlund), r as unsigned
__int128 (N < 2^100), P_k kept mod 2^128 plus a "P_k > N" flag, and an exit-3
abort for any candidate deeper than 240 trits.
search/run.py: same CLI and JSON as g0; compiles the engine into build/
(name carries the source hash) and computes leaf_digest from its output.

T0: PASS (full, including brute force). T1 at N = 2*3^24: unsharded 1.225e7
events/s mean (std 1e5, 3 repeats); 4 shards in parallel 4.859e7 events/s
aggregate; output equals verify/tree_ref.py 2*3^24 0 1.

